      {
        "@value": "The Pannonica Jazz Orchestra is a multi-generational collection of Canada’s finest Jazz musicians.The all-female ensemble, led by Trombonist/Arranger Angela Pincente, features compositions primarily composed and arranged by women specifically for this ensemble. The PJO’s mission is to highlight the contributions of women in music and provide a space to showcase their artistry. COVER: $20"
